tem/uploads/fae/image/asset/2268/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Yellowbrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2268/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Yellowbrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2268/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Yellowbrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2268/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Yellowbrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2268/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Yellowbrick.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2268/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Yellowbrick.jpg","As data volumes continue to explode and data analytics have evolved from a nice-to-have to a business-critical application for decision-making, enterprises need high-performance, flexible and reliable data warehouses more than ever. That’s why top companies in every major vertical have turned to Yellowbrick Data, a data warehouse solution specifically built for the analytic needs of the world’s largest enterprises. Today’s high-tech analytics solutions need to have the quality, concurrency, compatibility, support and ecosystem integration enterprises expect, and outperform incumbents on both price and performance to boot. With this in mind, Yellowbrick built a standards-based, full-stack enterprise data warehouse that takes advantage of the capacity, speed and concurrency benefits of flash technologies. As a result, their customers experience radical improvements in analytic performance along with significantly reduced operating costs. We’re thrilled to be on this journey on the Yellowbrick road to greatness!","Yellowbrick Data is the innovation leader in modern data warehousing, built to empower companies in every vertical to make better, data-driven decisions.","Yellowbrick Data - IVP Portfolio - Enterprise Tech VC in Data Warehousing  ","Yellowbrick Data - IVP Portfolio  ","The innovation leader in modern data wareho